      "ayah_number": 1,
      "text_tajweed_html": "ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مَا فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَمَا فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَلَهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَمْدُ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِۚ وَهُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَكِيمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>رُ <span class=end>١</span>"
